  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Veggie_Lasagna?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d1/Veggie_Lasagna.png/revision/latest?cb=20240211180053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Veggie lasagna\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Veggie lasagna\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Veggie lasagna</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 74</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 532</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  1 h 40 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 63</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Pasta Kitchen</span><span title=\"Pasta kitchen\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-kitchen-20183\" title=\"Pasta Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pasta Kitchen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 148</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1 h 25 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Veggie lasagna</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 74.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making veggie lasagna</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6b/Pasta_Kitchen.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925221934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Pasta kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pasta kitchen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Pasta kitchen</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Veggie lasagna is made in the <a href=\"/wiki/pasta-kitchen-20183\" title=\"Pasta Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Kitchen</a>.\n</p><p>To make veggie lasagna, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wheat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/cheese-2318\" title=\"Cream\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cream\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/tomato-sauce-19456\" title=\"Tomato sauce\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tomato sauce\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/fresh-pasta-19449\" title=\"Fresh pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fresh pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 1 hour and 40 minutes to make a plate of veggie lasagna, and 1 hour and 25 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> kitchen. Each plate gives players 63 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling veggie lasagna</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Veggie lasagna can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5,328 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 plates.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make veggie lasagna costs 488 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> coins.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 to 2 veggie lasagna per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Veggie lasagna is very hard to find in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-pasta-kitchen-products-21815\" title=\"Category:Pasta Kitchen Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Kitchen Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/broccoli-pasta-30755\" title=\"Broccoli Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Broccoli Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gnocchi-20283\" title=\"Gnocchi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gnocchi\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pasta-20285\" title=\"Lobster Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/mushroom-pasta-31953\" title=\"Mushroom Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mushroom Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-carbonara-28427\" title=\"Pasta Carbonara\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pasta Carbonara\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/spicy-pasta-29374\" title=\"Spicy Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Spicy Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/veggie-lasagna-20284\" title=\"Veggie Lasagna\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Veggie Lasagna\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</