  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Veggie Lasagna.png|left|200px|Veggie lasagna]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 74\n |price = 1 to 532\n |time = 1 h 40 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|pastak|bigger|link=Pasta Kitchen}}\n |xp = 63\n |base = 148\n |dia = 5\n |time3 = 1 h 25 min\n}}\n'''Veggie lasagna''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 74.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making veggie lasagna'''===\n[[File:Pasta Kitchen.png|150px|left|Pasta kitchen]]\nVeggie lasagna is made in the [[Pasta Kitchen]].\n\nTo make veggie lasagna, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Carrot.png|75px|Wheat|link=Carrot]]\n|[[File:Cheese.png|75px|Cream|link=Cheese]]\n|[[File:Tomato Sauce.png|75px|Tomato sauce|link=Tomato Sauce]]\n|[[File:Fresh Pasta.png|75px|Fresh pasta|link=Fresh Pasta]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour and 40 minutes to make a plate of veggie lasagna, and 1 hour and 25 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] kitchen. Each plate gives players 63 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling veggie lasagna'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Veggie lasagna can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5,328 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 plates.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make veggie lasagna costs 488 {{Infoicon|Coin}} coins.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 veggie lasagna per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Veggie lasagna is very hard to find in the [[Daily Dirt]].\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Gemüselasagne\n|es = Lasaña vegetal\n|fr = Lasagnes Végétariennes\n|it = Lasagne vegetariane\n|nl = Vegetarische Lasagne\n|no = Vegetarlasagne\n|zh = Veggie Lasagna\n}}\n[[pt-br:Lasanha vegetariana]]\n[[ru:Овощная лазанья]]\n\n[[Category:Pasta Kitchen Products]]\n[[Category:Carrot Products]]\n[[Category:Cheese Products]]\n[[Category:Tomato Sauce Products]]\n[[Category:Fresh Pasta Products]]",
